#: templates/eos_tax/tax-changes.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The corporation wallet only shows the corporation's own cut, so the ingame\n"
"                rate is not in it directly. It is recovered from the kills "
"behind each bounty: what the\n"
"                NPCs were worth against what arrived. Every move of that "
"share by at least\n"
"                %(minimum)s percentage points is listed, as long as the new "
"level held for two\n"
"                days - a corporation that switched three times appears three "
"times. The minimum\n"
"                is set on the settings page."
msgstr ""
"El wallet de la corporation solo muestra su propia parte, así que el ingame "
"rate no está ahí directamente. Se reconstruye a partir de los kills detrás "
"de cada bounty: lo que valían los NPC frente a lo que llegó. Se lista cada "
"movimiento de esa parte de al menos %(minimum)s puntos porcentuales, siempre "
"que el nuevo nivel se mantenga dos días: una corporation que cambió tres "
"veces aparece tres veces. El mínimo se define en los ajustes."

